WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.794
Why is everything so hard?!

00:00:04.963 --> 00:00:07.132
This is a wonderful comedy,
it's about more

00:00:07.132 --> 00:00:08.758
than just trying for a family.

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:11.302
At it's heart, it's about
people and life.

00:00:12.303 --> 00:00:14.222
Show me your best
manager point.

00:00:15.598 --> 00:00:16.224
Wow.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:17.475
You're ready.

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:20.270
I love that Nikki is banging
her own drum,

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.522
but I feel like she's found,
with Jason, that he just

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:23.898
allows her to be herself.

00:00:24.649 --> 00:00:26.943
It's a real matter of faking
it until you make it,

00:00:26.943 --> 00:00:28.027
in my personal life.

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:30.947
And also for Jason. He's just
trying to be a grownup,

00:00:30.947 --> 00:00:33.116
because apparently you've
to be a grownup to have kids.

00:00:33.908 --> 00:00:34.743
How'd it go?

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:35.660
Really well.

00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:36.661
Yay.

00:00:36.661 --> 00:00:37.996
I managed to convince them.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:39.330
To give you the job?

00:00:39.748 --> 00:00:41.040
No, to keep my current one.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.168
So everyone in series two is
kind of having their own

00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:44.335
malfunctions of life.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:48.798
Every character has flaws, but
they're so lovable at the same time.

00:00:49.758 --> 00:00:51.843
Listen man, I need a bit of,
uh, relationship advice.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:54.763
I'm single and I'm at a wedding
with my wife and her boyfriend,

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:56.306
so yeah, I'm definitely
your guy.

00:00:56.306 --> 00:01:00.560
Freddy is lost in a world where
he doesn't have the anchor of his wife

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.561
and his kids.

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:03.813
Yeah I think he's learning
hard lessons.

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:06.357
I was never here.

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:08.067
This is an illusion. Okay?

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:08.734
Okay.

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:11.571
There is a boy.

00:01:11.946 --> 00:01:15.784
You'd think the social worker
is terribly organized, terribly calm.

00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:21.247
Of course Penny is chaotic, and crazy, and
mad, and then that's just, was wonderful to play.

00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:23.374
Amen.

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:24.083
Amen.

00:01:24.709 --> 00:01:25.418
Namaste.

00:01:26.294 --> 00:01:29.547
The doubts that Karen has about
her relationship with Scott

00:01:29.547 --> 00:01:32.258
sort of bubble to the
surface in season two.

00:01:32.717 --> 00:01:33.843
You've got to take
more responsibility-

00:01:33.843 --> 00:01:35.470
Um, I've been babysitting.

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:37.013
It's not even called that
when they're yours.

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:40.683
It's really comforting to
watch other people

00:01:40.683 --> 00:01:42.769
making mistakes and you
kind of feel reassured that

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:43.770
everyone makes mistakes.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:46.981
I think everyone is trying
to slowly figure it all out.

00:01:47.357 --> 00:01:50.527
I'm not sure we ever do, really
properly, figure it all out though, so-

00:01:50.527 --> 00:01:51.361
I figured it out.

00:01:51.361 --> 00:01:52.362
No you haven't.

